WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.835
- [Gary] Gary, how are you?
- Tom.

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.085
Nice to meet you.
- [Gary] How are you, brother?

00:00:03.085 --> 00:00:05.151
- [Man] Alright, so we'll start 
off with that first question.

00:00:05.151 --> 00:00:08.175
Should people make 
New Year's resolutions?

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.278
- People should make New Year's
resolutions if they're actually

00:00:11.278 --> 00:00:13.614
watching this
video on January 1st.

00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:16.216
If they're watching it on
December 23rd they should make

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.352
December 23rd resolutions.

00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:22.055
Waiting miraculously to when the
calendar flips to start making

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:26.059
your life better is silly at
best and pisses me off at worst.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.389
And so, whenever you're watching
this because it was on the

00:00:28.389 --> 00:00:30.864
internet and thus that means
you could watch this on

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.534
June 17, 2017 make 
a resolution every day

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.403
of your life 'cause you 
only get one at-bat.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:39.473
The reason people struggle with 
having a New Year's resolution

00:00:39.473 --> 00:00:42.009
and sticking to it is 
because it was a tactic

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:43.477
to do a New Year's resolution.

00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:45.379
Hence, why my 
first answer was right

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:46.379
which is when you actually

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.349
decide to make a 
change in your life,

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:52.419
whether about weight or job 
or going out with somebody

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:55.622
or relationships, that's when
you actually pull it off.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:58.108
It's religion, not tactics.

00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:01.962
- [Man] Awesome, cool.
That's all we need.

00:01:01.962 --> 00:01:03.463
- Great.
(group laughter)

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.950
Amazing. You got it.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.926
(R&amp;amp;B music)

